#: src/printable/components/printable-infinity-sudoku-page/printable-infinity-sudoku-page.tsx
msgid "Yes, along with Everest, Platinum Blonde and Golden Nugget. The booklet prints the puzzles as they were originally published."
msgstr "Ya, bersama Everest, Platinum Blonde, dan Golden Nugget. Buklet mencetak sudoku sebagaimana dipublikasikan aslinya."

#: src/difficulty/components/hell-sudoku-page/hell-sudoku-page.tsx
msgid "Yes, by construction. Nightmare stops at AIC, and no Hell board can be solved with anything Nightmare allows. Our sample measures Hell at SE {hellSeRatingRange} and Nightmare at SE {nightmareSeRatingRange}."
msgstr "Ya, secara konstruksi. Mimpi buruk berhenti di AIC, dan tidak ada sudoku Neraka yang bisa diselesaikan dengan apa pun yang diizinkan Mimpi buruk. Sampel kami mengukur Neraka pada SE {hellSeRatingRange} dan Mimpi buruk pada SE {nightmareSeRatingRange}."

#: src/home/components/home-page/home-page.tsx
msgid "Yes, in the iOS and Android apps. Once installed, {SITE_NAME} generates and solves puzzles entirely on your device, so it plays the same with no connection."
msgstr "Ya, di aplikasi iOS dan Android. Setelah dipasang, {SITE_NAME} membuat dan menyelesaikan sudoku sepenuhnya di perangkat Anda, jadi dimainkan sama saja tanpa koneksi."

#: src/printable/components/printable-easy-sudoku-page/printable-easy-sudoku-page.tsx
#: src/printable/components/printable-hard-sudoku-page/printable-hard-sudoku-page.tsx
#: src/printable/components/printable-hell-sudoku-page/printable-hell-sudoku-page.tsx
#: src/printable/components/printable-infinity-sudoku-page/printable-infinity-sudoku-page.tsx
#: src/printable/components/printable-medium-sudoku-page/printable-medium-sudoku-page.tsx
#: src/printable/components/printable-nightmare-sudoku-page/printable-nightmare-sudoku-page.tsx
msgid "Yes, with no account and no watermark, and every puzzle’s solved grid is included at the back."
msgstr "Ya, tanpa akun dan tanpa tanda air, dan grid terselesaikan setiap sudoku disertakan di bagian belakang."

#: src/home/components/home-page/home-page.tsx
msgid "Yes. {SITE_NAME} is free and source-available, with no in-app purchases, subscriptions or paywalled difficulty levels."
msgstr "Ya. {SITE_NAME} gratis dan kode sumbernya tersedia, tanpa pembelian dalam aplikasi, langganan, atau tingkat kesulitan berbayar."

#: src/difficulty/components/infinity-sudoku-page/infinity-sudoku-page.tsx
msgid "Yes. Both are in the Infinity set, along with Platinum Blonde and Golden Nugget. Each game reshuffles digits, rows and columns, so the grid looks different every time while the puzzle stays the same."
msgstr "Ya. Keduanya ada di kumpulan Tak Terhingga, bersama Platinum Blonde dan Golden Nugget. Setiap permainan mengacak angka, baris, dan kolom, jadi grid terlihat berbeda setiap kali sementara sudokunya tetap sama."

#: src/printable/components/printable-easy-sudoku-page/printable-easy-sudoku-page.tsx
msgid "Yes. Easy is the source tier for the large-print PDF, sampled at {PRINTABLE_LARGE_PRINT_SIZE} puzzles with bigger cells for readers who want more room to write."
msgstr "Ya. Mudah adalah tingkat sumber untuk PDF cetak besar, dengan sampel {PRINTABLE_LARGE_PRINT_SIZE} sudoku dengan sel lebih besar bagi pembaca yang menginginkan ruang menulis lebih lega."

#: src/printable/components/printable-sudoku-page/printable-sudoku-page.tsx
msgid "Yes. Every difficulty booklet and the large-print set carry the full solved grids on the last pages, generated by the same solver that verifies every puzzle has exactly one solution before it ships."
msgstr "Ya. Setiap buklet tingkat kesulitan dan set cetak besar memuat grid terselesaikan lengkap di halaman terakhir, dibuat oleh solver yang sama yang memverifikasi bahwa setiap sudoku memiliki tepat satu solusi sebelum dirilis."

#: src/difficulty/components/infinity-sudoku-page/infinity-sudoku-page.tsx
msgid "Yes. Every grid is checked by a Dancing Links exact-cover solver and a bitmask solver before it ships, and each has exactly one solution."
msgstr "Ya. Setiap grid diperiksa oleh solver exact-cover Dancing Links dan solver bitmask sebelum dirilis, dan masing-masing memiliki tepat satu solusi."

#: src/printable/components/printable-newbie-sudoku-page/printable-newbie-sudoku-page.tsx
msgid "Yes. Every puzzle in the booklet is solvable with a full house or a naked single alone, so no candidate marking or elimination logic is ever required."
msgstr "Ya. Setiap sudoku di buklet bisa diselesaikan hanya dengan sel kosong terakhir atau tunggal telanjang, jadi tidak pernah dibutuhkan penandaan kandidat atau logika eliminasi."

#: src/difficulty/components/infinity-sudoku-page/infinity-sudoku-page.tsx
msgid "Yes. Our sample measures Hell at SE {hellSeRatingRange}, and every Infinity puzzle carries a published rating between {lowestRatingLabel} and {highestRatingLabel}. Hell boards still yield to our technique ladder; Infinity boards do not."
msgstr "Ya. Sampel kami mengukur Neraka pada SE {hellSeRatingRange}, dan setiap sudoku Tak Terhingga memiliki peringkat terpublikasi antara {lowestRatingLabel} dan {highestRatingLabel}. Sudoku Neraka masih tunduk pada tangga teknik kami; sudoku Tak Terhingga tidak."

#: src/printable/components/printable-newbie-sudoku-page/printable-newbie-sudoku-page.tsx
msgid "Yes. The PDF downloads free, with no account and no watermark, and includes a full solution key for every puzzle."
msgstr "Ya. PDF diunduh gratis, tanpa akun dan tanpa tanda air, dan menyertakan kunci jawaban lengkap untuk setiap sudoku."

#: src/printable/components/printable-sudoku-page/printable-sudoku-page.tsx
msgid "Yes. This site places no restriction on printing or redistributing the PDFs — including handing them out in a classroom, a tutoring session or a worksheet packet."
msgstr "Ya. Situs ini tidak membatasi pencetakan atau pendistribusian ulang PDF — termasuk membagikannya di kelas, sesi les, atau paket lembar kerja."
